{
    "title": "Notes Launcher: Notepad, To-do",
    "description": "Jot down thoughts, ideas and important information with Notes Launcher. Swipe right from your home screen to create quick notes or to-do lists, share them with friends and family, add locks to secure sensitive information, and more.\r\n\r\nPlease note: As a launcher app, the layout of your home screen may change after install. Don\u2019t worry, all your apps are still on your phone - they just may be in a different location. To learn more, please visit our FAQ section: https://notepadhome.app/#faq  \r\n\r\nWith a launcher app, you get the added benefits of: \r\n\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access \r\nCreate notes & to-do lists instantly by simply swiping right from your home screen!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Home screen widget\r\nSee the time, weather, and more, conveniently on your home screen with our customized widget.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Wallpaper\r\nPersonalize your home or lock screen with a wide selection of beautiful themed wallpapers. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut\r\nUse the Notes Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get quick access to your to-do lists. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search \r\nApps and web search has never been easier. Search for installed apps or the web (powered by Yahoo) from multiple access points.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n\u2713 Note-taking\r\n\u2713 Text formatting tools\r\n\u2713 Color-code notes\r\n\u2713 Lock notes\r\n\u2713 Categorize\r\n\u2713 Sort\r\n\u2713 Find\r\n\u2713 Share\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcddCreate notes & checklists: Quickly jot down ideas and important information on the go. Make a grocery list, a wish list, or a to-do list, then check off items as you accomplish them.\r\n\r\n\u2728Text formatting tools: Enhance your notes with the rich-text editor. Change font sizes, italicize or underline text, and create bulleted or numbered lists.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Color-code notes: Choose a note color to easily categorize and prioritize information. Whether it\u2019s managing work tasks or weekend plans, color-coding makes organizing your notes easier.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd10 Lock notes: Secure sensitive information like passwords, bank account details, medical prescriptions and more in a locked note.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Categorize: Save notes under custom categories like vacation checklists or emergency contacts. Group related notes together to instantly access them at any time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea6 Sort: Use the sorting filter to arrange notes by the date they were modified or in ascending/descending order of creation to easily find what you need.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Find: Quickly find what you\u2019re looking for with Notes Launcher\u2019s intuitive search feature. Enter a keyword or phrase in the app\u2019s search bar to quickly locate relevant notes.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1d Share: Planning a travel itinerary? Working on a group project? Share your notes with family and friends through email, social media and other messaging apps.\r\nIt\u2019s simple, effective, and free to use, helping you stay organized every day. Get started with the Notes Launcher today!\r\nPlease write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.\r\n\r\nYou give your consent to install Notes Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app's Terms and Conditions & Privacy Policy.\r\n\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\n\r\nExplore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://notepadhome.app/#faq\r\nFor questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://notepadhome.app/contact-us\r\n\r\nTerms of Service - https://notepadhome.app/terms-of-service\r\nPrivacy Policy - https://notepadhome.app/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Jot down thoughts, ideas and important information with Notes Launcher. Swipe right from your home screen to create quick notes or to-do lists, share them with friends and family, add locks to secure sensitive information, and more.<br><br>Please note: As a launcher app, the layout of your home screen may change after install. Don\u2019t worry, all your apps are still on your phone - they just may be in a different location. To learn more, please visit our FAQ section: https://notepadhome.app/#faq  <br><br>With a launcher app, you get the added benefits of: <br>\ud83d\ude80 One-swipe access <br>Create notes &amp; to-do lists instantly by simply swiping right from your home screen!<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1Home screen widget<br>See the time, weather, and more, conveniently on your home screen with our customized widget.<br><br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Wallpaper<br>Personalize your home or lock screen with a wide selection of beautiful themed wallpapers. <br><br>\ud83c\udfe0 Home screen shortcut<br>Use the Notes Launcher shortcut on your home screen to get quick access to your to-do lists. <br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Multi-touchpoint search <br>Apps and web search has never been easier. Search for installed apps or the web (powered by Yahoo) from multiple access points.<br><br>Key features:<br>\u2713 Note-taking<br>\u2713 Text formatting tools<br>\u2713 Color-code notes<br>\u2713 Lock notes<br>\u2713 Categorize<br>\u2713 Sort<br>\u2713 Find<br>\u2713 Share<br><br>\ud83d\udcddCreate notes &amp; checklists: Quickly jot down ideas and important information on the go. Make a grocery list, a wish list, or a to-do list, then check off items as you accomplish them.<br><br>\u2728Text formatting tools: Enhance your notes with the rich-text editor. Change font sizes, italicize or underline text, and create bulleted or numbered lists.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Color-code notes: Choose a note color to easily categorize and prioritize information. Whether it\u2019s managing work tasks or weekend plans, color-coding makes organizing your notes easier.<br><br>\ud83d\udd10 Lock notes: Secure sensitive information like passwords, bank account details, medical prescriptions and more in a locked note.<br><br>\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Categorize: Save notes under custom categories like vacation checklists or emergency contacts. Group related notes together to instantly access them at any time.<br><br>\ud83d\udea6 Sort: Use the sorting filter to arrange notes by the date they were modified or in ascending/descending order of creation to easily find what you need.<br><br>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Find: Quickly find what you\u2019re looking for with Notes Launcher\u2019s intuitive search feature. Enter a keyword or phrase in the app\u2019s search bar to quickly locate relevant notes.<br><br>\ud83e\udd1d Share: Planning a travel itinerary? Working on a group project? Share your notes with family and friends through email, social media and other messaging apps.<br>It\u2019s simple, effective, and free to use, helping you stay organized every day. Get started with the Notes Launcher today!<br>Please write to us should you have any queries or comments about the app, including recommendations for new features. Also, please note that you can uninstall it at any time.<br><br>You give your consent to install Notes Launcher from the Google Play\u2122 Store by clicking the button above. You also agree to this app&#39;s Terms and Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy.<br><br>Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.<br><br>Explore our FAQ section to find helpful information: https://notepadhome.app/#faq<br>For questions or feedback, reach out to us through our contact form: https://notepadhome.app/contact-us<br><br>Terms of Service - https://notepadhome.app/terms-of-service<br>Privacy Policy - https://notepadhome.app/privacy-policy",
